\par \par \uc2 An exam room at Lovering Health Center, an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  provider, in Greenland, N.H. PHOTO: Kayana Szymczak for The Wall Street Journal\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  could also figure in the governor race. Republican Gov. \uc2 Chris Sununu\uc2 , who identifies as pro-choice, signed the bill last year containing the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions, saying he wasn't going to veto the state budget over a few provisions he didn't like. The state Legislature has since repealed the ultrasound mandate and voted to allow abortions for fatal fetal anomalies.\par \par \uc2 The governor's GOP-led executive council, which approves state funding requests, has also denied state funding to family planning clinics that also provide abortions, including Planned Parenthood.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 How do you think the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  will play out in the November midterms? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Ms. Hassan met recently with staff from one of those healthcare clinics. Staff talked about the cuts they have had to make\u8212\'20\'14including letting one longtime staff member go\u8212\'20\'14and their concern about future restrictions.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Sununu's Democratic opponent, state Sen. Tom Sherman, is making \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access a pillar of his campaign. He said New Hampshire has always had a strong libertarian streak and opposes government intrusions.\par \par \uc2 Ben Vihstadt, a spokesman for Mr. Sununu, said that regardless of what happens with the Supreme Court, there will be access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the state. In a recent interview with WMUR, Mr. Sununu didn't rule out signing a future budget with further \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scholars.unh.edu/survey_center_polls/693/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A University of New Hampshire poll in April }}}\uc2  found the prospective matchups between Ms. Hassan and several possible GOP opponents were all neck-and- neck, while Mr. Sununu led Mr. Sherman by 26 percentage points. The poll didn't include potential House matchups.\par \par \uc2 Democratic Rep. \uc2 Chris Pappas\uc2 , who represents one of the state's two House districts, said the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access being taken away is salient with voters.\par \par \uc2 "They want to know how we can ensure that generations to come aren't going to have less rights than people living today," he said.\par \par \uc2 Karoline Leavitt, a former aide in the Trump White House who hopes to face off against Mr. Pappas in the fall, said economic and border concerns were more important issues than \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "They like to create these manufactured crises in order to distract from the real problems," she said.\par \par \uc2 Marie Drury, 63, a retiree from Salem, said she would vote Republican no matter what, but supporting a candidate who is against \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is an added bonus. "I believe life starts at the beginning, it's not a dog, it's not a cat. It's a human being," she said.\par \par \uc2 Laura Wicik, 25, a legal assistant from Manchester, said she would vote for Democrats, though she feels hopeless about their ability to pass laws over GOP opposition.\par \par \uc2 "Our rights are being taken away," she said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Eliza Collins at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:eliza.collins+1@wsj.com."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eliza.collins+1@wsj.com. }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/new-hampshire-tests-abortions-role-in-midterm-elections-11654347601"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New Hampshire Tests \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22 's Role in Midterm Elections  }}}