\par\par \uc2 U.S. News\par \uc2 US\par \b \uc2 Louisiana House Stops  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Bill That Allowed Murder Charges Against Women; Closely watched measure proposed the harshest  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban in the U.S.\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto \par \uc2 449 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 May 2022\par 02:13 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Louisiana's Republican-led House of Representatives stopped a measure Thursday that could have allowed women who obtain abortions to be charged with murder.\par \par \uc2 The proposal, which was passed out of a state House committee last week, sought to recognize a fertilized embryo as a person and made it possible for both doctors and pregnant women to be charged under the state's homicide statute if they performed or received an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The bill, which proposed the harshest \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban in the U.S., caused friction within Louisiana's Republican caucus. A majority of GOP lawmakers voted for a package of amendments to the legislation that removed the provisions allowing murder charges. They said the state already had strong laws to prevent abortions.\par \par \uc2 Republican and Democratic politicians around the country have pushed for new laws either restricting or protecting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in advance of an upcoming \uc2 U.S. Supreme Court{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/states-move-to-restrict-or-protect-abortion-rights-after-leak-of-draft-opinion-overturning-roe-v-wade-11651608822"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decision on whether to overturn Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 , the 1973 decision that established a constitutional right to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/leaked-draft-of-supreme-court-opinion-indicates-roe-v-wade-may-be-overturned-11651554510?mod=article_inline"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 leaked draft opinion }}}\uc2  from the Supreme Court suggested that the court is preparing to take that step. After the leak, the court said no final decision has been made. A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-confirms-authenticity-of-leaked-draft-opinion-overruling-roe-v-wade-11651592725"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruling is expected by the end of June }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Louisiana already has a so-called trigger law enacted 16 years ago that would ban most abortions if the Supreme Court overturns Roe.\par \par \uc2 Many conservative states have laid the groundwork to ban most abortions if Roe is overturned. This year so far, half-a-dozen states have enacted legislation banning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2 , a policy group that supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights and tracks national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  statistics.\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 How might the proposed restrictions in Louisiana shape the larger regulatory landscape? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 According to Guttmacher, about 22 states are poised to ban or heavily restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if Roe v. Wade is overturned.\par \par \uc2 The Louisiana proposal faced outcry from \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -rights and antiabortion groups, which said it could make women who have miscarriages afraid to seek treatment for fear they would be accused of taking \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 -inducing drugs or other actions to harm the fetus, and that it could also criminalize parts of the in vitro fertilization process.\par \par \uc2 Gov. \uc2 John Bel Edwards\uc2 , an antiabortion Democrat, on Wednesday said he wouldn't sign the bill. "To suggest that a woman would be jailed for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is simply absurd," he said.\par \par \uc2 Write to Laura Kusisto at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:laura.kusisto@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 laura.kusisto@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/louisiana-house-stops-abortion-bill-that-allowed-murder-charges-against-women-11652408028"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Louisiana House Stops \b  \highlight22Abortion\b0 \highlight22  Bill That Allowed Murder Charges Against Women  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220513ei5d0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
