\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Senate Passes Bill to Protect Supreme Court Justices' Families; Move follows protests in wake of leaked  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2 -ruling draft\b0\par\par\uc2 By Siobhan Hughes \par \uc2 383 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 May 2022\par 01:14 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14The Senate swiftly passed a bill to expand police protections for Supreme Court justices to include their immediate family members, in the wake of protests following a leaked draft ruling that indicated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/roe-wade-abortion-supreme-court-explainer-11651601806"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the court could overturn Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The measure passed late Monday by unanimous consent. The broad support in the Senate suggests a clear pathway to passage in the House, but no immediate plan was set.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/leaked-draft-of-supreme-court-opinion-indicates-roe-v-wade-may-be-overturned-11651554510"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A leaked draft opinion }}}\uc2  published last week by Politico suggested that the conservative wing of the court was preparing to undo the 1973 Roe decision, which established \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a constitutional right, in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-hears-arguments-in-landmark-mississippi-abortion-case-11638354602"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a Mississippi \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  case }}}\uc2  the justices are currently considering. Chief Justice \uc2 John Roberts\uc2  confirmed the draft was authentic but cautioned it wasn't final.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court is currently surrounded by security fencing to guard against potential threats. Over the weekend, some protesters demonstrated outside the home of Supreme Court Justice \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2  in suburban Chevy Chase, Md.\par \par \uc2 Senate Minority Leader \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2  (R., Ky.) accused progressives of trying to harass justices at their homes in order to achieve a desired judicial outcome, saying they were trying to "replace the rule of law with the rule of mobs." He also said the White House had been slow to condemn such protests.\par \par \uc2 At the daily White House briefing Monday, press secretary \uc2 Jen Psaki\uc2  said protesters "should never resort to violence, to threats, to intimidation in any way, shape, or form."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/congress-set-to-clash-on-abortion-following-draft-opinion-on-roe-v-wade-11652041319"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Senate is scheduled to vote }}}\uc2  this Wednesday on whether to take up legislation to assert healthcare providers' right to provide an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  before a fetus is viable, and to say that a patient has a right to receive one, in line with current Supreme Court precedent. In a 50-50 Senate where most legislation requires a 60-vote supermajority to advance, the bill is expected to be blocked.\par \par \uc2 If Roe is overturned, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-state-abortion-laws-stand-if-roe-v-wade-is-overturned-11651614828"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 states' law would determine \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  policy }}}\uc2 . Some states have plans in place to sharply curtail access to abortions, while other states have moved to codify existing law.\par \par \uc2 Write to Siobhan Hughes at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:siobhan.hughes@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 siobhan.hughes@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/senate-passes-bill-to-protect-supreme-court-justices-families-11652145294"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Senate Passes Bill to Protect Supreme Court Justices' Families  }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220510ei5a000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
