\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Michigan's  \highlight22\uc2 Abortion \highlight\uc2  Tensions Reflect Uncertain Future in Battleground States; State's Democratic governor and Republican leaders gear up before possible overturning of Roe v. Wade by Supreme Court\b0\par\par\uc2 By Laura Kusisto \par \uc2 1,379 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 May 2022\par 11:00 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 DETROIT\u8212\'20\'14A leaked {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/leaked-draft-of-supreme-court-opinion-indicates-roe-v-wade-may-be-overturned-11651554510"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 draft Supreme Court opinion overturning Roe v. Wade }}}\uc2 has raised uncertainty about the future of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the country, but nowhere does that future look less clear than in politically moderate states like Michigan.\par \par \uc2 This swing state, which voted for Republican Donald Trump in 2016 and Democrat \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  in 2020, is on the precipice of becoming either a state with some of the tightest \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions or one that provides robust rights for the procedure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/where-state-abortion-laws-stand-if-roe-v-wade-is-overturned-11651614828"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Some 22 largely Republican-led states }}}\uc2  around the country are poised to ban most abortions if the Supreme Court overturns Roe v. Wade, while many Democratic-led states are calling for fewer restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the adoption of new \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights under state law.\par \par \uc2 Michigan is one of at least a handful of states including Wisconsin, Kansas and Pennsylvania where Republicans and Democrats are deadlocked over whether to heavily restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  or allow it widely. The future could hang on ballot initiatives in some of these states, as well as the results of the next elections for governor or the legislature. \par \par {\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw640\pich426\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal9600\pichgoal6390
