\par\par \uc2 Politics and Policy\par \uc2 Politics\par \b \uc2 Antiabortion Supporters Rally in Washington as Supreme Court Weighs Overruling Roe v. Wade; Marchers say they hope for 'a monumental decision' as court considers case to overturn protections for women's  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  rights\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alexa Corse \par \uc2 423 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 January 2022\par 20:42 GMT\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal Online\par \uc2 WSJO\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON\u8212\'20\'14Antiabortion supporters rallied in the nation's capital on Friday saying they were hopeful that the Supreme Court was on the cusp of overruling the landmark 1973 Roe v. Wade decision that made \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  legal nationwide.\par \par \uc2 The annual "March for Life" rally in Washington comes this year as the high court is reviewing the decades-old legal structure governing abortions across the U.S. and as several states {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/texas-abortion-law-gives-a-glimpse-of-a-post-roe-world-11635942617"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have passed their own restrictions on \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The court last month heard arguments in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-hears-arguments-in-landmark-mississippi-abortion-case-11638354602"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a case over a 2018 Mississippi law }}}\uc2  that banned abortions for women 15-weeks pregnant. In that litigation, the justices are weighing whether to overturn protections to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights recognized in Roe v. Wade.\par \par \uc2 Advocates at the march expressed optimism about what the Supreme Court will do in the Mississippi case.\par \par \uc2 "We anticipate a monumental decision from the Supreme Court," said Rep. Julia Letlow, a Louisiana Republican who attended the event along with a number of other members of Congress, speaking to supporters at the event.\par \par \uc2 In a separate case, the Supreme Court on Thursday allowed Texas' six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban to remain in effect indefinitely, blocking litigation against the law while the state's highest court weighs a procedural question regarding the enforcement of the measure.\par \par \uc2 The Supreme Court's three liberal justices dissented, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/supreme-court-permits-continued-enforcement-of-texas-six-week-abortion-ban-11642715257"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calling the case an affront to women's rights }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 SHARE YOUR THOUGHTS\par \par \uc2 What do you think the March for Life will accomplish? Join the conversation below.\par \par \uc2 Despite cold temperatures in the 20s, thousands attended Friday's march, which is scheduled each year around the anniversary of the Roe v. Wade decision. The event included a rally on the National Mall followed by a march to the Supreme Court. Several streets were closed to traffic due to the event, Washington, D.C., police said.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/illinois-abortion-clinics-are-preparing-for-a-potential-post-roe-world-11638419374"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Supporters of \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  rights have raised alarms }}}\uc2  about the high-profile court cases and state laws restricting the procedure.\par \par \uc2 "People must have the right to decide when to stay pregnant and have a child," said Herminia Palacio, president and chief executive of the Guttmacher Institute, a research group that supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. "The facts are clear: \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is healthcare, plain and simple."\par \par \uc2 Write to Alexa Corse at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:alexa.corse@wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alexa.corse@wsj.com }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsj.com/articles/antiabortion-supporters-rally-in-washington-as-supreme-court-weighs-overruling-roe-v-wade-11642797334"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Antiabortion Supporters Rally in Washington as Supreme Court Weighs Overruling Roe v. Wade }}}\par \par \uc2 Document WSJO000020220121ei1l006hd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw254\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3810\pichgoal600
